// error: 13:36: method 'empty' can't be used as a value here
// error: 27:18: method 'greet' isn't static, so it needs a value of type User
// error: 28:15: async method 'load' can't be used as a value yet
// error: 29:15: generic method 'pick' can't be used as a value
// error: 30:17: can't tell the type arguments of Box.new
// error: 31:43: can't tell the type arguments of Box.new
// error: 32:32: expected fn(int) -> string, found fn(string) -> string
// error: 33:21: case 'circle' carries values, so it must be called
// error: 34:17: 'map' can't be used as a value
